<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FAFCFE', padding: 0, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 36, width: '1152px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0E9B78', borderRadius: 5, padding: '3px 11px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>第 45 节</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>核心知识点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· ★ 六个常见错误逐条自查</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>错误 1：★ 方法忘记写 self</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· NameError: name 'count' is not</text><text x='82' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>defined（左边忘了写）</text><text x='82' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 属性值永远不变 / 方法结束后"数据丢了"</text><text x='82' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 属性变成 None 或 0</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>错误 2：方法定义时忘了第一个参数 self</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· TypeError: area() takes 0 positional</text><text x='486' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>arguments but…</text><text x='486' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 定义时少写了 self，但调用时 Python</text><text x='486' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>会自动传入对象，结果参数数量对不上。</text><text x='486' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 每个方法（除了 __init__、__str__</text><text x='486' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>等双下划线方法）定义时，第一个参数必须是 self。</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>错误 3：忘记冒号或缩进（和函数一样，</text><text x='890' y='153' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>但更隐蔽）</text><text x='890' y='192.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· SyntaxError: expected ':' /</text><text x='890' y='211.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>IndentationError…</text><text x='890' y='240.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· def 行末必须有 :；class</text><text x='890' y='259.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>体内所有代码（包括方法）必须有缩进。</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
            <text x='64' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Python 讲授课件 · 逐节版</text>
            <text x='1216' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' textAnchor='end' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>单元 8 · 第 45 节</text>
        </svg>
    </Box>
</Slide>
